<title>USA: Westerbeke to buy back up to 215,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>Westerbeke to buy back up to 215,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>AVON, Mass. 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westerbeke Corp said on Friday its board authorized the repurchase of up to 215,000 shares of the company's oustanding common stock.</p>
<p>Westerbeke said it would purchase shares from time to time in the open market or private transactions, effective immediately.  Shares would be used to meet obligations under the company's employee incentive and benefit plans, it said.</p>
<p>Westerbeke designs, makes and markets marine engine and air conditioning products.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
